WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.294 --> 00:00:11.526
In this lesson, you will use four tools you need in daily field and office work: leave and attendance, leads, school visit reports and expense claims.

2
00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:16.028
To ask for leave, click Leave in the menu.

3
00:00:16.894 --> 00:00:31.966
Choose the type of leave: casual, sick, unpaid or other. Then choose a colleague to cover for you. While you are away, new tasks for you are shared with them, so nothing sits idle.

4
00:00:32.836 --> 00:00:43.036
Pick the first and last day, add a short reason, and click Ask for leave. Your manager and the founders are told straight away.

5
00:00:43.891 --> 00:00:50.851
Your request appears under My leave. If your plans change, click Cancel leave.

6
00:00:51.712 --> 00:01:01.336
Next, leads. Click Leads in the menu. This is your list of schools and contacts you are working to win.

7
00:01:02.204 --> 00:01:11.348
Click Add a lead. Type the contact's name, the school, and a phone number. Then click Add lead.

8
00:01:17.401 --> 00:01:31.705
After every call, click Log a call. Record what happened, and set a follow-up date, so nothing is forgotten. The Follow-up due filter shows who you promised to call back today.

9
00:01:32.568 --> 00:01:42.384
Now, expenses. Click Expenses. Spent your own money on work? Claim it here.

10
00:01:43.247 --> 00:01:49.487
Describe what it was for, enter the amount in rupees, and choose a category.

11
00:01:52.041 --> 00:02:06.105
Attach a photo of the receipt if you have one, up to five megabytes. Then click Submit claim. A founder is notified, and you can withdraw the claim until it is decided.

12
00:02:06.963 --> 00:02:19.107
Finally, school visits. If you are assigned a visit, open that task right after you finish. Click Visits to see all visit reports.

13
00:02:19.968 --> 00:02:43.872
On the visit task itself, there is a Visit report. Choose how it went: great, good, needs follow-up, or problem. A problem alerts the founders immediately. Describe what happened, add how many people attended, and click Save visit report. Add photos with Attach file.

14
00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:56.515
That is leave, leads, expenses and visits. In the next lesson, we look at scores, challenges, kudos, incentives and referrals.
